WEBVTT

00:01.659 --> 00:05.201
For everyone not sitting back
and watching this in a well-lit room...

00:05.326 --> 00:07.534
YOU'LL GET A KICK!

00:10.617 --> 00:14.409
It's March. Spring vacation.

00:15.159 --> 00:19.326
Before my eyes, a southern island beach...

00:19.409 --> 00:22.159
Oh, there you are!

00:28.701 --> 00:30.492
...and my angel.

00:37.742 --> 00:42.451
If I should get invited by you

00:42.451 --> 00:44.326
There's no way he will

00:44.326 --> 00:48.992
We'll start off with a kiss

00:49.159 --> 00:51.034
I won't allow it

00:51.034 --> 00:55.742
Just the two of us in one room

00:55.742 --> 00:57.701
Stop right there!

00:57.701 --> 01:02.742
I want to become an adult

01:02.742 --> 01:04.201
Because I love you so much

