Your number one

01:49.201 --> 01:54.159
Your number one

01:49.202 --> 01:54.159
Your number one

02:03.201 --> 02:06.076
THE WET SANDS OF MARCH

02:07.076 --> 02:10.742
HORIKYO ACADEMY

02:07.367 --> 02:11.742
Over my parents' objections,

02:07.368 --> 02:11.742
I entered a school for performing arts...

02:10.742 --> 02:18.201
STUDENT DORMS

02:11.742 --> 02:13.117
and rather than study for my exams,

02:13.117 --> 02:15.409
I devoted myself to researching

02:13.118 --> 02:15.409
acting and action, but...

02:18.201 --> 02:20.117
REJECTED

02:20.451 --> 02:23.826
Again? What's the problem?!

02:25.367 --> 02:28.492
It's gotta be the impression my eyes give.

02:29.409 --> 02:33.409
ASSEMBLY HALL

02:30.117 --> 02:33.409
All right, please remain if I call your name.

02:33.826 --> 02:35.284
CONFERENCE ROOM

02:36.701 --> 02:50.117
And now let's move along to the second
stage interviews, please. Biker Boy Ranger

02:46.785 --> 02:50.117
AUDITION

02:47.909 --> 02:50.117
Again?

02:50.909 --> 02:52.242
Then, one day...

02:52.492 --> 02:55.617
"Man who revolutionized the 90's hero genre...

02:55.617 --> 02:58.742
now on the hunt for super heroine project..."

02:58.951 --> 03:01.701
A super heroine show?

03:09.367 --> 03:14.034
That's right. In a month, we start shooting
a new series with these five girls.

03:14.034 --> 03:14.366
SUPER TRANSFORMING COSPLAYERS The
Cosmopolitan Prayers Project Planning Book

03:14.367 --> 03:17.409
A heroine team of
super transforming cosplayers.

03:17.409 --> 03:20.076
Today's the first day of a group getaway
to build them up for their roles.

03:21.117 --> 03:24.284
The purpose is to build up
the strength of these girls...

03:24.284 --> 03:28.284
to do intense actions scenes
without stunt doubles.

03:28.784 --> 03:33.784
And I'm the cameraman who will record
their growth for the making-of video.

03:34.326 --> 03:38.701
My name's Naoto Ooizumi. Age 17,
and soon to be high school senior.

03:49.951 --> 03:52.242
Okay, introduce yourselves, one at a time.

03:52.534 --> 03:53.742
Introduce ourselves?

03:54.076 --> 03:56.242
Oh? Who's first? Who's first?

03:58.451 --> 04:02.576
Huh? Me?! Oh, what should I say? Um...

04:03.076 --> 04:05.492
She's adorable, even when she looks worried.

04:05.784 --> 04:10.742
Hi! I'm Natsumi Yagami,
who plays Miko-Rayer, and I'm 17!

04:10.742 --> 04:11.534
God, that smile! I can't take it!

04:11.534 --> 04:13.992
I'm a senior studying for
college entrance exams,

04:11.536 --> 04:13.992
God, that smile! I can't take it!

04:13.992 --> 04:17.909
and I really hope to do well as an actress,
so I'm betting on this!

04:18.034 --> 04:21.242
Which would explain... the lucky underwear!

04:22.534 --> 04:23.951
Hey!

04:25.659 --> 04:27.492
Um! No! I didn't see anything just now!

04:27.492 --> 04:31.492
Ooizumi, you'd better cut that out!

04:31.492 --> 04:33.492
S-sure!

04:33.951 --> 04:38.617
Um, I'm Youko Katsuragi,

04:33.952 --> 04:38.617
who plays Sister-Rayer.

04:38.617 --> 04:42.242
17 years old. I'll do my best.

04:42.617 --> 04:45.492
Same age as me. Seems really calm, too.

04:45.492 --> 04:47.159
I'm next, right?

04:47.409 --> 04:51.201
I'm Hikaru Jougasaki, who portrays Sari-Rayer.

04:51.409 --> 04:54.284
I'm 14 years old and will be
a senior in middle school.

04:54.534 --> 04:57.409
Nice. She's so refined.

04:57.576 --> 04:59.242
Okay, next is...

04:59.242 --> 05:03.076
As Rabian-Rayer, Sayaka Imamura.

05:03.076 --> 05:06.576
Currently 14 years old and
will be a middle school senior!

05:06.784 --> 05:10.367
No freaking way! She's the same age?!

05:10.909 --> 05:11.409
That girl needs to drink more milk!

05:11.409 --> 05:14.367
I'm doing my best to
mark my tenth year doing this!

05:11.411 --> 05:14.367
That girl needs to drink more milk!

05:14.367 --> 05:17.034
Portraying Dian-Rayer...

05:17.034 --> 05:19.492
Miku Hayasaka!

05:19.492 --> 05:24.034
I'm 11, and going into the
sixth grade in elementary school!

05:24.326 --> 05:24.659
And this one's in elementary school?

05:24.659 --> 05:26.701
I can't wait to try some action scenes!

05:24.660 --> 05:26.701
And this one's in elementary school?

05:26.867 --> 05:29.992
Okay, that's it for today.

05:29.992 --> 05:33.409
And here's someone who probably
doesn't need any reintroductions:

05:33.409 --> 05:37.409
Naoto Ooizumi, the cameraman
for our making-of video.

05:37.784 --> 05:42.617
He'll be shooting everything
till the series wraps, so wish him well!

05:42.659 --> 05:44.951
We look forward to working with you!

05:47.826 --> 05:51.159
Hey! Hey! Can you see my tan line?

05:51.284 --> 05:52.617
Hey there!

05:53.784 --> 05:55.534
Ms. Ikita!

05:55.534 --> 05:57.909
They seem to have taken to you.

05:57.909 --> 06:00.742
And you seem to have captured
the girls' pretty faces really well.

06:01.076 --> 06:02.701
Oh... Not really.

06:02.701 --> 06:04.867
Don't be modest.

06:04.867 --> 06:06.076
By the way...

06:06.076 --> 06:06.992
Yes?

06:06.992 --> 06:09.951
You seem to be taking a lot
of footage of Yagami.

06:09.867 --> 06:12.492
KA
THUMP!

06:10.659 --> 06:12.534
She's really nice, isn't she?

06:13.451 --> 06:15.201
Kanou also complimented her.

06:16.034 --> 06:18.617
He said she'd make for some nice pictures.

06:18.951 --> 06:21.576
I'd expect her to have the
endorsement of the show's creator.

06:22.284 --> 06:24.159
Ikita, don't!

06:24.159 --> 06:24.491
SUPER TRANSFORMING COSPLAYERS The
Cosmopolitan Prayers Project Planning Book

06:24.492 --> 06:27.992
Right! Sorry! Sorry! Nobody can know that, huh?

06:27.034 --> 06:28.617
NAOTO OOIZUMI

06:28.826 --> 06:31.617
Can't wait to see the making-of video
when it's done.

06:32.034 --> 06:33.034
I'll do my best.

06:33.034 --> 06:36.534
Don't forget to give it a plot, O great Creator.

06:37.451 --> 06:38.701
Ikita!

06:38.701 --> 06:41.159
Oops! That's a secret, right?

06:41.451 --> 06:43.159
Jeez...

06:45.576 --> 06:47.492
HORIKYO ACADEMY
A FEW DAYS LATER

06:51.992 --> 06:54.451
COMMENCEMENT
CEREMONY

06:52.117 --> 06:54.409
Oh... The wind's being a perv!

06:54.951 --> 06:57.117
It's Spring...

06:57.117 --> 07:00.992
Come to think of it, this is where

06:57.118 --> 07:00.992
I first met Yagami.

07:02.534 --> 07:04.201
REJECTED

07:04.201 --> 07:06.367
ONE YEAR EARLIER

07:05.117 --> 07:06.367
Again?

07:06.909 --> 07:10.742
Oh... Why?

07:20.784 --> 07:22.992
What pretty cherry blossoms.

07:24.451 --> 07:26.117
They sure are.

07:26.117 --> 07:29.951
I saw it from my class. It caught my attention.

07:29.951 --> 07:33.326
I thought it was so pretty, so I came to see it.

07:36.701 --> 07:38.576
Yagami...

07:38.576 --> 07:41.909
I'd like us to be in the same class,
for this last year, at least.

07:47.117 --> 07:48.534
Ow...

07:53.534 --> 07:54.451
S-sorry!

07:54.451 --> 07:56.784
N-no! My fault!

07:57.951 --> 07:59.492
Katsuragi?

07:59.951 --> 08:01.159
Ooizumi...?

08:02.701 --> 08:05.326
What are you doing in that uniform?

08:05.326 --> 08:10.534
Well, this is close to where we're
shooting, so I transferred in for the year.

08:10.534 --> 08:13.367
I'm an actor, so entrance exams
aren't really a concern for me.

08:13.992 --> 08:15.201
Oh, I see.

08:15.201 --> 08:16.701
Still, I'm glad.

08:16.701 --> 08:17.534
Huh?

08:17.742 --> 08:20.701
That the first person I met here...
was you, Ooizumi.

08:20.951 --> 08:22.242
Huh?

08:23.159 --> 08:24.367
Bye!

08:30.242 --> 08:32.076
Squishy-squishy...

08:32.076 --> 08:34.034
Ooizumi!

08:35.409 --> 08:37.409
Jougasaki!

08:37.409 --> 08:39.451
Um, I...

08:39.451 --> 08:42.284
Wait, that uniform...

08:50.534 --> 08:58.201
Um, I transferred here from Hokkaido, to avoid
the commute, so... I'm looking forward to this!

08:59.242 --> 09:01.117
Ooizumi!

09:01.117 --> 09:02.534
Huh?

09:02.534 --> 09:04.451
Here! Up here!

09:06.242 --> 09:08.367
M-Miku!

09:10.159 --> 09:12.326
Can you tell what this is?

09:13.867 --> 09:17.034
Oh! It's a Biker Boy Rangers badge!

09:17.034 --> 09:20.076
My dad won it for me in an auction.

09:20.076 --> 09:21.701
And it's an original version!

09:21.701 --> 09:25.117
Miku, you really are a

09:21.702 --> 09:25.117
total Akiba geek, aren't you?

09:25.117 --> 09:27.201
Here, let me show you!

09:27.367 --> 09:31.742
Biker change... GO!

09:39.201 --> 09:40.742
You okay?

09:40.742 --> 09:46.159
Miku, maybe you shouldn't show
quite so much in front of everyone?

09:47.117 --> 09:49.951
Ohhh! I get you!

09:50.076 --> 09:53.326
From now on, I'll make sure to wear bloomers.

09:53.326 --> 09:55.201
S-sure thing...

09:57.492 --> 10:00.076
What is going on today?

10:00.076 --> 10:02.242
Ooizumi!

10:02.617 --> 10:03.742
Yagami!

10:05.367 --> 10:06.951
Sayaka Imamura!

10:06.951 --> 10:10.034
Well? I can do a good impression of her, can't I?

10:10.034 --> 10:11.826
I love you, Ooizumi!

10:13.742 --> 10:16.742
Th-that's ridiculous! What do you mean by that?!

10:17.492 --> 10:20.492
That reaction... Just like my
adult horoscope said.

10:21.659 --> 10:23.742
"A rival will appear."

10:23.742 --> 10:26.451
Rival? What do you mean?

10:26.451 --> 10:28.617
That's my secret, Pal.

10:33.534 --> 10:35.826
Show some respect to your elders!

10:37.076 --> 10:38.534
Imamura!

10:41.284 --> 10:42.909
Ow...

10:44.826 --> 10:45.534
Naughty.

10:47.284 --> 10:50.076
You were the one coming on to me!

10:50.659 --> 10:52.576
Nothing to be ashamed of, Kid.

10:52.992 --> 10:54.659
I told you...!

10:54.867 --> 10:57.076
I hope you'll do the right thing.

10:57.242 --> 11:01.701
I'm worn out. Still, considering
what's happened today...

11:02.367 --> 11:06.534
I get the feeling this morning
started a real lucky streak for me.

11:07.451 --> 11:11.201
The way things are going,

11:07.452 --> 11:11.201
Yagami and I will be in the same class!

11:11.701 --> 11:13.117
Except we're not.

11:18.909 --> 11:22.159
I guess we don't always get what we want.

11:31.326 --> 11:32.867
Ooizumi?

11:39.367 --> 11:41.826
I was late for my first day of class.

11:42.242 --> 11:43.242
Yagami...

11:43.242 --> 11:46.201
Still, still was such a surprise.

11:46.451 --> 11:49.867
I was picked to be the lead in the show,

11:49.867 --> 11:53.117
and it was even more of
a surprise when I heard...

11:53.117 --> 11:56.534
that our making-of cameraman
was my classmate!

11:56.951 --> 12:00.701
Classmate? You and I?!

12:01.284 --> 12:03.034
Yes!

12:03.034 --> 12:04.534
You see, I...

12:04.784 --> 12:07.534
I've had a premonition.

12:07.909 --> 12:10.284
Ever since that first day we met here.

12:25.201 --> 12:28.034
Oh, I've had it with this pervy wind!

12:28.326 --> 12:32.076
April, the season when the
flowers are in fullest bloom.

12:32.992 --> 12:36.951
The beginning of my season of romance.

12:53.784 --> 12:59.076
You might notice, as I peep through the viewfinder

12:59.367 --> 13:02.326
That you're the only one

13:02.326 --> 13:06.201
That I was following

13:06.826 --> 13:09.701
Bit by bit, our time together

13:09.701 --> 13:12.867
Starts to overlap

13:13.701 --> 13:16.076
And these feelings I can't hide

13:16.076 --> 13:19.909
Don't have to be hidden anymore

13:20.742 --> 13:24.159
Like the moon and the stars long ago

13:24.159 --> 13:26.784
Once promised

13:27.534 --> 13:31.117
The two of us will always

13:31.117 --> 13:34.784
Be connected

13:34.867 --> 13:38.117
Stronger than anyone, closer than anyone

13:38.117 --> 13:41.576
Yes, I'm here to love you

13:41.826 --> 13:45.159
In my eyes and in my heart

13:45.159 --> 13:48.409
You blaze for me

13:48.534 --> 13:51.867
Even if the winds blow and the rains fall

13:52.076 --> 13:55.326
I'll stay with you, as long as we're together

13:55.451 --> 13:58.951
Yesterday, surely, tomorrow, even moreso

13:58.951 --> 14:02.826
You'll be that much dearer to me

14:08.826 --> 14:23.826
NEXT
EPISODE

14:10.326 --> 14:13.534
What's going on? Ooizumi, you naughty boy.

14:15.701 --> 14:18.659
What's got you looking
so bent out of shape, Kid?

14:18.659 --> 14:23.367
something will happen today
with you and the girl of your destiny.
